From eb50df9716aeac3bdeb50333885c6a9a8d6a927f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:46:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(build): restore assets/ui/cube.png the packaging scripts
 install; pin their asset paths

6792a8a3f (PR #1179) deleted the launcher icon that package-appimage,
-flatpak, -linux, -macos and -snap read; v0.19.0's linux and macos jobs
failed on it. Restored byte for byte from v0.18.0. New xtask test fails on
any OS when a path the scripts or release.yml name is missing. PROCESS_VERSION 57.

Fixes #1428

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
